---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
---

<Base title="Changelog · Tracelane" description="Release notes and changelog for Tracelane.">
  <section class="container-prose py-24">
    <p class="font-mono text-xs text-fg-dim mb-4 tracking-wider lowercase">changelog</p>
    <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight text-fg">Changelog.</h1>
    <p class="mt-6 text-lg text-fg-muted leading-relaxed">
      Detailed release notes live at
      <a href="https://github.com/tracelane" class="underline decoration-fg-subtle hover:decoration-fg transition-colors" rel="noopener">github.com/tracelane</a>. Each release is Cosign-signed with SLSA Build L3 provenance.
    </p>

    <div class="mt-16 space-y-12">
      <article>
        <p class="font-mono text-xs text-pop lowercase tracking-wider">unreleased</p>
        <h2 class="mt-2 text-xl font-semibold text-fg">V1.0.0 — released</h2>
        <ul class="mt-4 space-y-2 text-fg-muted">
          <li>— Rust gateway across 30+ LLM providers</li>
          <li>— Full-fidelity OTel GenAI observability backend</li>
          <li>— Pre-flight policy at the gateway (schema-violation + tool-definition-drift)</li>
          <li>— Tamper-evident audit ledger: SHA-256 hash chain + Ed25519-signed Merkle root</li>
          <li>— CLI: tlane verify (audit-chain verification)</li>
          <li>— CLI importers: tlane import-helicone, tlane import-litellm</li>
        </ul>
      </article>
    </div>

    <p class="mt-16 text-sm text-fg-subtle">
      Get product updates —
      <a href="/#notify" class="underline decoration-fg-subtle hover:decoration-fg">notify list</a>.
    </p>
  </section>
</Base>
